{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22162","headline":"归田三首 二 · 白居易","name":"归田三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"种田意已决，决意复何如。\n卖马买犊使，徒步归田庐。\n迎春治耒耜，候雨辟菑畲。\n策杖田头立，躬亲课仆夫。\n吾闻老农言，爲稼慎在初。\n所施不卤莽，其报必有余。\n上求奉王税，下望备家储。\n安得放慵惰，拱手而曳裾。\n学农未爲鄙，亲友勿笑余。\n更待明年後，自拟执犂锄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}